  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caribbean Disaster Emergency Management Agency (CDEMA) Emergency Response Teams</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will support the provision of emergency response assistance through the Caribbean Disaster Emergency Management Agency to its Participating States that are affected by any hazard where the impact is at a Level 2 or Level 3. This Regional Response Mechanism (RRM) includes deployment of surge response teams including for operational support, needs assessment, logistics, emergency telecommunication, search and rescue or medical teams as well as utility restoration.</narrative>
  </description>
